From: PowerPhone research platform <powerphone@csr460.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Select the D5/EP6 native-q192 speaker path with ASP bypass

Persist the live D5/source-5 and normal-ASPRX1 amplifier routing. Own the
AoC speaker ASP bypass for the lifetime of the physical research playback
route; stock effects retain 48 kHz processing assumptions. Snapshot and
restore the previous mode only after hard-off while ownership is intact.

Start only when the complete 3840-frame ALSA ring has been filled, preserving
1920-frame transfer periods and the separate 7680-frame framework queue.
Microphone effects and non-speaker routes remain unchanged.

